Storage: online data are collected in Qualtrics{% if d.has_audio %} and Microsoft Teams{% endif %} under UCL's licence and exported to {{ p.storage }}. {% if d.in_person %}Data recorded on devices during in-person sessions are transferred to UCL storage the same day and deleted from the device. {% endif %}Main research data are stored in a project folder restricted to named team members.

Keeping personal information separate: names, contact details, the linking key and consent forms are stored in a separate restricted folder accessible only to the PI. Research data are labelled with participant numbers only.{% if p.paper_consent and d.in_person %} Paper consent forms are scanned to the restricted folder after each session and the originals kept in a locked cabinet on UCL premises.{% endif %}

Security: UCL storage is encrypted and protected by UCL login with multi-factor authentication. No data are stored on personal devices or non-UCL cloud services.
